assertion  ST.select.001
says       A conditional assertion whose option is not claimed is UNSUPPORTED.
when       NEVER
test       t/unused.c
expect     UNSUPPORTED

assertion  ST.select.002
says       An unmet "needs" is UNRESOLVED.
needs      nosuchthing
test       t/unused.c
expect     UNRESOLVED

assertion  ST.select.003
says       An assertion with no test is UNTESTED.
expect     UNTESTED

assertion  ST.select.004
says       An untestable assertion is UNTESTED, with its reason.
class      untestable
reason     planted
expect     UNTESTED

assertion  ST.select.005
says       A missing test file is UNINITIATED.
test       t/does-not-exist.c
expect     UNINITIATED

assertion  ST.select.006
says       An alternative that is claimed satisfies "A|B".
when       NEVER|BASE
test       t/006-alt-pass.c
expect     PASS
